     * One publication per WhatsApp Business Account the flow was pushed to.
     *
     * Scopes: whatsapp_flows:read.
     *
     *
     * @throws ApiException
     *
     * @see https://api.sendseven.com/api/v1/docs#/WhatsApp%20Flows/list_wa_flow_publications_api_v1_whatsapp_flows__definition_id__publications_get
